  <Docs>
    <summary>An inclusive mismatched-pixel allowance, limited by a count, percentage, or both.</summary>
    <remarks>The default value is <see cref="P:SkiaSharp.Testing.SKPixelMismatchBudget.Exact" />. Percentages are percentage points of the compared pixel count, not fractions. Their inclusive pixel limits are floored from the invariant round-trip decimal representation of the percentage to avoid binary rounding at decimal boundaries.</remarks>
  </Docs>
